{
  "id": "MRK.16",
  "number": "16",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Marko 16",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duunooda Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghweelmeeda Sabaato ghang'eat geaba Mariyayda siguura Magdalena ea Salome ea Mariyayda was gheamata Yakobo gaweay ghwasha nagheeda ng'andit jea ghwayeasha musta Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iimuchu nea gudugoorearu aseeta eaweeda madeeda bea wiikajeanda gaweay Gadeemsu ea ghwahita heeda bung'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay nea gabalooleada aba naweeda nea gwayeesha geat, “Ghamneawa gayghoarakghrakghta ng'eaha lagheaneedida haw bea ghuuta shoomanda bung'eedean?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoang'wearda ak ghwadaah lagheaneedida nea sigeanda, (Nea mii lagheana gil gidahaw muuchi.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duu gwasik ghuuta shoomanda bung'eeda ghwadaah Gheareemaneeni akwa hang'deesh nea goopteada aba meatkweeda geatinda dugwa, Ghahamng'eanyi muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Gheareemaneeni gadeemgiga, “Ada ghahameegwa ng'eanyi. Ghaanali beadi oogaseadayi Yesuheeda Nasareti, singoorsa uhuuda beehiida. Siisi niduudu eara hiji mudugwanda. Ang'ula heeda siyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi agooga aweayeena oatawa iidi giinealangiga ikaaschiin ea Betaro gideaba niisheedeawaneegwa gawa Galilaya. Iyoahiti hoowa gajadaakta gidaghayi rukuteayda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata Ghabeawa hoowa bea bung'eedean nea gwasalda, aba gideaba niboadan ak ea ning'ut muuwda nea ghahamng'eanyi. Eamudu gwarukusa sih ng'ashaan aba gideaba nibeal muuchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gwaroonyi Mariyayda siguura Magdalena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata duunooda Yesu nea beashata eaweeda madeeda bea wiikajeanda gil goohiimsa geaw Mariyayda siguura Magdalena, was gatmooda ghayi aruuteawa Yesu saseeda meangeeniga asispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa Mariyayda Magdalena, ak gawa gwarukusa fuga eawoojisu mideaydooschi Yesu, nea abeeda aba damandida fugiga gooyeawda nea gagutu heareega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea Ghwayiiy gideaba Yesu ea majeek ea gideaba nidaah Mariyayda Magdalena ea meamwasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gwaroonyi giinealan iyeenya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iimuchu goohiimsa geaw Yesu giinealan iyeenya nea niyamwa deakta. Abeeda Giinealang'su gaweay madamnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara Saawa gaweay ak gwarukusa suurja. Earapeadi sirukusean ghanyea mamwasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gwaroonyi giinealan damwanagi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu aba huuydeanda goohiimsa geaw Yesu giinealan damwanagi hita Yesu nea gweagiischi. Goowoowsa Yesu saawa muuchi aba hang'ooynacheeka iheenga nyaawa, ea gideaba mamwasa ng'asheegiga bea fuga eadu iita duunoadaanyiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiissa gwayeesha, “Aweayeena ng'eanyiisean ak goorukwiidi Giijasta Miy aba heeda buuneassean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida mwas ak geepaatiisan gayghaghu, nea siida mamwasa gajeergweaksa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda eara gwadeagooda gaygoodeaydooschi fugiga mideawa masaweegean, aba gheawungeasu gaygooruuta meangeeniga ak gaygabaloola iit nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eara ghoang'waay ichipkeega ghana eara eabiiw siida gichea ghabwar, ea manda gili jea gwahissa. Nea inyeessa Gayghoang'waay iheenga fuga miyeani ak gaheaba”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gawa humng'eeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu Ng'utamiida was Yesu goobalool saawa amahit, geanung' gawa humng'eeda goobiida meatkweeda geatinda dugwa bea ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweay giinealanga ng'eanyiisean nea gwarukwiida Giijasta Miy. Gwasin Ng'utamiida gadiyeeda sea saawa ak goomajeek Giijasi aba gwadeagooda adeaydooschi saawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
